# Build context for tests/integration/nmos/amwa/Dockerfile.node.
#
# The repo is 574 MB, of which 7 MB is Go. The rest is vendor spec PDFs,
# wire fixtures and captures — none of it reaches the compiler (there is
# no go:embed anywhere in the tree), and shipping it would make every
# image build a multi-minute upload.
#
# Excluding a directory here breaks the build the moment something DOES
# embed it, which is the trade: a fast context in exchange for keeping
# this list honest.
.git/
.cache/
captures/
bin/

# Vendor specs and wire fixtures.
internal/*/assets/
internal/*/testdata/
internal/*/*/testdata/
tests/integration/nmos/amwa/dhs
tests/integration/nmos/amwa/results/

# Docs, tooling and infrastructure — none of it compiles.
docs/
ansible/
scripts/
web/
*.md
